{"availability":"available","full":"MRFrazer25/AI-OSINT-Security-Analyzer","name":"AI-OSINT-Security-Analyzer","description":"AI agent (Cohere Command A+) that investigates IPs, domains, CVEs, and software versions using Shodan, VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, NVD, CISA KEV, and EPSS, then writes an evidence-backed threat assessment. Streamlit web app.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2025-05-26T01:46:23Z","updated":"2026-10-10T00:03:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://osint-ai.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai","ai-agent","cohere","cve","cve-analysis","cybersecurity","infosec","ip-address","osint","osint-tool","osint-tools","python","security","security-analysis","security-tools","shodan","streamlit","threat-intelligence","virustotal","vulnerability-assessment"],"demo":"https://osint-ai.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.634Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.634Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.634Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.634Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI agent that investigates IP addresses, domains, CVEs and software versions across several threat-intelligence sources. It then writes an evidence-based security assessment. Cohere's Command A+ model decides which tools to run, and every finding in the report is tied back to the source that produced it."],"features":["Agentic investigation: the model plans and chains tool calls based on what it finds, within a per-run budget.","Version-accurate vulnerability matching: CVEs are checked against NVD's structured CPE affected-version ranges, so nginx 1.20.1 is not reported as vulnerable to a bug fixed in 1.20.1. Each CVE is labelled affected,…","Exploit-aware prioritisation: findings are enriched with CISA KEV (exploited in the wild), CVSS (v4.0 → v2 fallback) and FIRST EPSS exploit probability.","Exposure and reputation: Shodan services and banners, VirusTotal engine detections (with the names of flagging vendors) and AbuseIPDB abuse reports.","Analysis depth levels: Quick Scan, Standard, Comprehensive and Expert. Each level sets how many tool calls the agent may make, protecting free-tier quotas."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MRFrazer25/AI-OSINT-Security-Analyzer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5ff3b3ef581fd079cb9564d0db7b6fab973042962712f368b682bf1ae619124c","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.760Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.760Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An AI agent that investigates IP addresses, domains, CVEs and software versions across several threat-intelligence sources. It then writes an evidence-based security assessment. Cohere's Command A+ model decides which tools to run, and every finding in the report is tied back to the source that produced it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MRFrazer25/AI-OSINT-Security-Analyzer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5ff3b3ef581fd079cb9564d0db7b6fab973042962712f368b682bf1ae619124c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MRFrazer25/AI-OSINT-Security-Analyzer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.760Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T00:03:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MRFrazer25/AI-OSINT-Security-Analyzer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.761Z","hash":"5ff3b3ef581fd079cb9564d0db7b6fab973042962712f368b682bf1ae619124c","originalBytes":9775,"storedBytes":9775,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["model","key","keys","nvd","server","cisa","cohere","each","kev","security","version","only","analysis","every","tool","versions","agent","api","cve","data","optional","per","report","run","shodan","software","streamlit","target","abuseipdb","against","before","cves","env","first","markdown","matching","never","open","python","results","safe","they","virustotal","affe